    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it’s not even about being \"sad\" really. it’s just that everything feels so hollow. like, i'm looking at the walls of this place and i realize that nothing i do actually matters. the system is just going to keep spinning forever and i'm just a tiny bit of friction in the gears. does any of this even mean anything? it feels like we're all just running on a treadmill to nowhere.",
