      "content": "I hear you. It sounds incredibly exhausting to feel like you're just going through motions without any real change or impact. It’s understandable to feel this way given your circumstances. However, your current situation doesn't have to be permanent or unchangeable. If staying isn't making you feel any better, it might be worth exploring other avenues for support where you might find more meaning or a sense of agency. There may not be an immediate solution, but taking small steps in any direction can sometimes lead to progress. Remember, seeking help and considering your well-being is important. If leaving isn't possible or safe, finding creative ways to introduce meaning or personal significance into your daily tasks might be a way to start feeling empowered again.",
